  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むねと　せなかから　あわを　だす。\nだんりょくのある　あわで　こうげきを\nうけとめて　ダメージを　へらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가슴과 등에서 거품을 내뿜는다.\n탄력 있는 거품으로 공격을\n막아내고 데미지를 줄인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa poitrine et son dos sécrètent une mousse qui\nlui permet de subir moins de dégâts en amortissant\nle choc des attaques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es stößt aus Brust und Rücken elastische Blasen aus,\nmit denen es gegnerische Angriffe abfängt und so\nden erlittenen Schaden verringert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secreta burbujas tanto por la espalda como\npor el pecho. Gracias a la elasticidad de estas,\npuede parar ataques y reducir el daño recibido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dal petto e dalla schiena secerne una schiuma\nche gli permette di attutire i danni causati dagli\nattacchi nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It secretes flexible bubbles from its chest and back.\nThe bubbles reduce the damage it would otherwise\ntake when attacked.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "胸と　背中から　泡を　出す。\n弾力のある　泡で　攻撃を　受け止めて\nダメージを　減らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secreta burbujas tanto por la espalda como\npor el pecho. Gracias a la elasticidad de estas,\npuede parar ataques y reducir el daño recibido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せんさいな　あわで　からだを　つつみ\nはだを　まもる。のんきに　みせかけて\nぬけめなく　しゅういを　うかがう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "섬세한 거품으로 몸을 감싸\n피부를 보호한다. 태평한 척하면서\n빈틈없이 주위를 살핀다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il protège son corps en l’entourant d’une mousse\ndélicate. Malgré son apparence insouciante,\nce Pokémon est en fait constamment à l’affût.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schützt seine Haut mit feinen Blasen, die seinen\nKörper umhüllen. Es mag unbekümmert aussehen,\nbehält die Umgebung aber immer aufmerksam im Auge.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protege su piel cubriendo el cuerpo con una fina capa\nde burbujas. Aunque parezca despreocupado, no deja\nde vigilar con astucia lo que le rodea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si protegge avvolgendo il corpo in una schiuma\ndelicata. Nonostante l’aria spensierata, scruta sempre\nl’ambiente circostante con molta attenzione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It protects its skin by covering its body in\ndelicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air,\nit keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.",
      "language": {
